// 测试机上的批量执行器（scripts/remote_batch.tx 把它交叉编成测试机的目标，同产物、清单与用例目录一起送去；
// 测试机上不需要解释器）。
//
// 用法：remote_exec <批目录>
// 读 <批目录>/manifest.txt（UTF-8，每行一项，字段以制表符分隔，字段内的 \ 制表符 换行写成 \\ \t \n）：
//   E <名字> <值>                          设环境变量（此后起的产物都带上）
//   I <键> <产物> <目录> <时限秒> <实参>...  运行 <批目录>/<产物>（正斜杠），工作目录为 <批目录>/trees/<目录>（空即批目录）
// 逐项写一行结果到标准输出：R <键的十六进制> <退出码> <stdout 的十六进制> <stderr 的十六进制>（全是 ASCII，经测试机的控制台代码页也
// 不走样）；超时退出码 −1、stderr 为 TIMEOUT，起不了为 −2。
import { join, nat } from "./build_lib";
import { Raw, captureRaw } from "./test_lib";

const DRAIN_NS: int = 10000000000;
const MAX_OUTPUT: int = 268435456;
const DIGITS: string = "0123456789abcdef";

export function escField(s: string): string {
    const b = bytesFromStr(s);
    const out = bytesNew(0);
    let i = 0;
    while (i < bytesLen(b)) {
        const c = bytesGet(b, i) ?? 0;
        if (c == 92) {
            bytesPush(out, 92);
            bytesPush(out, 92);
        } else if (c == 9) {
            bytesPush(out, 92);
            bytesPush(out, 116);
        } else if (c == 10) {
            bytesPush(out, 92);
            bytesPush(out, 110);
        } else {
            bytesPush(out, c);
        }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    return bytesToStr(out) catch "";
}

export function unescField(s: string): string {
    const b = bytesFromStr(s);
    const out = bytesNew(0);
    let i = 0;
    while (i < bytesLen(b)) {
        const c = bytesGet(b, i) ?? 0;
        if (c == 92 && i + 1 < bytesLen(b)) {
            const d = bytesGet(b, i + 1) ?? 0;
            if (d == 116) {
                bytesPush(out, 9);
            } else if (d == 110) {
                bytesPush(out, 10);
            } else {
                bytesPush(out, d);
            }
            i = i + 2;
        } else {
            bytesPush(out, c);
            i = i + 1;
        }
    }
    return bytesToStr(out) catch "";
}

export function hexBytes(b: Bytes): string {
    const out = bytesNew(0);
    let i = 0;
    while (i < bytesLen(b)) {
        const c = bytesGet(b, i) ?? 0;
        bytesPush(out, byteAt(DIGITS, c >> 4) ?? 48);
        bytesPush(out, byteAt(DIGITS, c & 15) ?? 48);
        i = i + 1;
    }
    return bytesToStr(out) catch "";
}

function nibble(c: int): int {
    if (c >= 48 && c <= 57) {
        return c - 48;
    }
    if (c >= 97 && c <= 102) {
        return c - 87;
    }
    return 0;
}

export function unhex(s: string): Bytes {
    const out = bytesNew(0);
    let i = 0;
    while (i + 1 < len(s)) {
        bytesPush(out, nibble(byteAt(s, i) ?? 0) * 16 + nibble(byteAt(s, i + 1) ?? 0));
        i = i + 2;
    }
    return out;
}

function field(xs: List<string>, i: int): string {
    return unescField(listGet(xs, i) catch "");
}

function seconds(s: string): int {
    let v = 0;
    let i = 0;
    while (i < len(s)) {
        const c = byteAt(s, i) ?? 0;
        if (c < 48 || c > 57) {
            return 120;
        }
        v = v * 10 + (c - 48);
        i = i + 1;
    }
    return v;
}

function runItem(dir: string, xs: List<string>): void {
    const key = field(xs, 1);
    const exe = join(dir, field(xs, 2));
    const tree = field(xs, 3);
    let cwd = dir;
    if (len(tree) > 0) {
        cwd = join(join(dir, "trees"), tree);
    }
    const argv: List<string> = listNew();
    let k = 5;
    while (k < listLen(xs)) {
        listPush(argv, field(xs, k));
        k = k + 1;
    }
    const limit = seconds(field(xs, 4)) * 1000000000;
    const r = captureRaw(nat(exe), argv, nat(cwd), limit, DRAIN_NS, MAX_OUTPUT) catch (e) {
        print("R\t" + hexBytes(bytesFromStr(key)) + "\t-2\t\t" + hexBytes(bytesFromStr(e.message)));
        return;
    };
    if (r.timedOut) {
        print("R\t" + hexBytes(bytesFromStr(key)) + "\t-1\t\t" + hexBytes(bytesFromStr("TIMEOUT")));
        return;
    }
    print("R\t" + hexBytes(bytesFromStr(key)) + "\t" + toStr(r.code) + "\t" + hexBytes(r.out) + "\t" + hexBytes(r.err));
}

function main(args: []string): int {
    if (len(args) != 1) {
        eprint("用法：remote_exec <批目录>");
        return 64;
    }
    const dir = args[0];
    const text = readFile(join(dir, "manifest.txt")) catch (e) {
        eprint("读不了清单：" + e.message);
        return 1;
    };
    for (line in strSplit(text, "\n")) {
        const xs = strSplit(line, "\t");
        const kind = listGet(xs, 0) catch "";
        if (kind == "E") {
            setEnv(field(xs, 1), field(xs, 2)) catch (e) {
                eprint("设不了环境变量 " + field(xs, 1) + "：" + e.message);
                return 1;
            };
        } else if (kind == "I") {
            runItem(dir, xs);
        }
    }
    return 0;
}
